{"root":"usak","ipa":"/u.sak/","core":"指损坏、破坏、毁坏，通常指物体、结构或系统的完整性受到损害，使其无法正常运作或失去原有价值。","pos":["动词"],"scenes":["高频","生活","工作"],"rootBlock":{"ipa":"/u.sak/","zh":"损坏，毁坏","phrases":[{"t":"usak parah","zh":"严重损坏"},{"t":"barang usak","zh":"损坏的物品"},{"t":"menjadi usak","zh":"变得损坏"}],"examples":[{"t":"Jalan itu usak karena banjir.","zh":"那条路因为洪水而损坏了。"},{"t":"Jangan biarkan mesin ini usak.","zh":"不要让这台机器损坏。"}]},"ders":[{"w":"usak","ipa":"/u.sak/","zh":"损坏的","phrase":{"t":"benda usak","zh":"破旧物品"},"example":{"t":"Rumah itu sudah usak.","zh":"那座房子已经破旧了。"}},{"w":"merusak","ipa":"/mə.ru.sak/","zh":"破坏，毁坏（及物动词）","phrase":{"t":"merusak lingkungan","zh":"破坏环境"},"example":{"t":"Dia tidak sengaja merusak mainan itu.","zh":"他不小心弄坏了那个玩具。"}},{"w":"kerusakan","ipa":"/kə.ru.sa.kan/","zh":"损坏，故障，破坏（名词）","phrase":{"t":"kerusakan mesin","zh":"机器故障"},"example":{"t":"Kerusakan itu sangat parah.","zh":"那个损坏非常严重。"}},{"w":"perusak","ipa":"/pə.ru.sak/","zh":"破坏者","phrase":{"t":"perusak tanaman","zh":"害虫（破坏植物者）"},"example":{"t":"Polisi menangkap perusak fasilitas umum itu.","zh":"警察抓住了那个破坏公共设施的人。"}},{"w":"dirusak","ipa":"/di.ru.sak/","zh":"被破坏","phrase":{"t":"dirusak orang","zh":"被人破坏"},"example":{"t":"Pagar itu dirusak oleh angin kencang.","zh":"栅栏被强风破坏了。"}}],"derSlugs":["usak","merusak","kerusakan","perusak","dirusak"],"model":"gemini-3.1-flash-lite","createdAt":"2026-10-01T02:28:00.200Z","src":"base"}